(text "REV S: FICTIONAL 64-LANE PEX90064 / 33x33mm / 82x45mm CARRIER\nPEX90064 has an invented 1024-ball map. 10 E1.S x4 plus CPU x4; 20 spare lanes. CPU288V 32GB MoP; PMIC/boot work remains open.\nCPU pin directions and power inputs are modeled. ERC power-driver errors expose unfinished supply domains.\nSee README.md and VALIDATION.json before manufacturing." (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "9f9c4cdf-68d8-42f6-befb-5af04ece0e4d"))
